    "body": "Thanks for doing this; LGTM. We can merge this whenever there is sufficient implementer interest, but if we want to merge it before TC39 stage 4 then instead of linking to https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-isimmutablebuffer we'll need to update the link to something that resolves. (See other examples of how HTML references pre-stage-4 TC39 proposals below the big list of terms.)\r\n\r\nI'll mark this \"do not merge yet\" until we're ready in that regard, either way, but the spec text itself looks great.",
